* d2s_p_cells.cdl: reference netlists of d2s_p_cells.gds (build_d2s_p.py, agent P, 2026-10-31).
* Devices as drawn, dummies included (D = S for a dummy).

* SA bulk = vdd here (one NWell with the tie on vdd); the circuit has vddo
.SUBCKT d2s_pd_p_c a en_3v3 vabp vddo vdd
MSA a en_3v3 vddo vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1
MSABP vabp en_3v3 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS d2s_pd_p_c

* RP1 is in the clamp frame (not here)
.SUBCKT d2s_ab_p_c a b dabp l1 l2 vabp vdd
MRP2 vabp vabp dabp vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6.66u l=0.6u ng=1 m=1
MFPL l1 vabp l2 vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6.66u l=0.6u ng=1 m=1
MABP b vabp a vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6.66u l=0.6u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS d2s_ab_p_c

.SUBCKT d2s_casc_p_c a l2 pl pr vbpc vdd
MPCL1 l2 vbpc pl vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=15u l=3u ng=1 m=1
MPCL2 l2 vbpc pl vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=15u l=3u ng=1 m=1
MPCR1 a vbpc pr vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=15u l=3u ng=1 m=1
MPCR2 a vbpc pr vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=15u l=3u ng=1 m=1
MBPC vbpc vbpc vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=4u ng=1 m=1
MDUM vdd vbpc vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=4u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS d2s_casc_p_c

.SUBCKT d2s_loads_c l2 pl pr vdd
Md0 vdd l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=4u ng=1 m=1
ML1 pl l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=4u ng=1 m=1
MR2 pr l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=4u ng=1 m=1
MR3 pr l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=4u ng=1 m=1
ML4 pl l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=4u ng=1 m=1
ML5 pl l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=4u ng=1 m=1
MR6 pr l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=4u ng=1 m=1
MR7 pr l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=4u ng=1 m=1
ML8 pl l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=4u ng=1 m=1
Md9 vdd l2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=4u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS d2s_loads_c

* tail rows: row 1 Aa C2b C1b Ba, row 2 Bb C1a C2a Ab; BP at the right end of row 2
.SUBCKT d2s_tails_c sa_A sa_B sa_C1 sa_C2 sb_A sb_B sb_C1 sb_C2 vbp vdd
MTd1 vdd vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTAa sa_A vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTC2b sb_C2 vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTC1b sb_C1 vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTBa sa_B vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTd5 vdd vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTd2 vdd vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTBb sb_B vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTC1a sa_C1 vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTC2a sa_C2 vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MTAb sb_A vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MBP vbp vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS d2s_tails_c

* tubs: ng = 2, w = 20u (2 x 10/1), bulk = source; dummies 10/1 ng=1 on vdd
.SUBCKT d2s_inputs_c vinp vref vinn vfb x y sa_A sa_B sa_C1 sa_C2 sb_A sb_B sb_C1 sb_C2 vdd
MAa y vinp sa_A sa_A sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=1u ng=2 m=1
MC2b x vfb sb_C2 sb_C2 sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=1u ng=2 m=1
MC1b x vfb sb_C1 sb_C1 sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=1u ng=2 m=1
MBa y vref sa_B sa_B sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=1u ng=2 m=1
MBb x vinn sb_B sb_B sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=1u ng=2 m=1
MC1a y vref sa_C1 sa_C1 sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=1u ng=2 m=1
MC2a y vref sa_C2 sa_C2 sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=1u ng=2 m=1
MAb x vref sb_A sb_A sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=1u ng=2 m=1
MDm00 vdd vdd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
MDm10 vdd vdd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
MDm01 vdd vdd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
MDm11 vdd vdd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS d2s_inputs_c

* d2s_n_cells.cdl: reference netlists of d2s_n_cells.gds, devices as drawn (one line per finger,
* dummies included), written by build_d2s_n.py 2026-10-31 (agent N). Bulk = vss (the p tie of the cell).

.SUBCKT sinks_6x6_c vbn vss x y
MBN_A0 vbn vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_A1 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_A2 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_A3 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_A4 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_A5 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_A6 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
Mdummy_A7 vss vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=6u ng=1 m=1
Mdummy_B0 vss vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_B1 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_B2 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_B3 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_B4 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_B5 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_B6 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
Mdummy_B7 vss vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=6u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS sinks_6x6_c

.SUBCKT sinks_6x6_s2d_c vbn vss x y
MBN_A0 vbn vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_A1 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_A2 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_A3 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_A4 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_A5 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_A6 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
Mdummy_A7 vss vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=6u ng=1 m=1
Mdummy_B0 vss vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_B1 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_B2 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_B3 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_B4 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSX_B5 x vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MSY_B6 y vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
Mdummy_B7 vss vbn vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=6u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS sinks_6x6_s2d_c

.SUBCKT d2s_casc_n_c b l1 vbnc vss x y
MCX_0 l1 vbnc x vss sg13_hv_nmos w=15u l=3u ng=1 m=1
MCX_1 l1 vbnc x vss sg13_hv_nmos w=15u l=3u ng=1 m=1
MCY_0 b vbnc y vss sg13_hv_nmos w=15u l=3u ng=1 m=1
MCY_1 b vbnc y vss sg13_hv_nmos w=15u l=3u ng=1 m=1
MBNC vbnc vbnc vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=8u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS d2s_casc_n_c

.SUBCKT d2s_ab_n_c a b dabn l1 l2 vabn vss
MABN a vabn b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=4.4u l=1u ng=1 m=1
MFNL l2 vabn l1 vss sg13_hv_nmos w=4.4u l=1u ng=1 m=1
MRN2 vabn vabn dabn vss sg13_hv_nmos w=4.4u l=1u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS d2s_ab_n_c

.SUBCKT d2s_pd_n_c b en_3v3_b vabn vss vsso
MSB b en_3v3_b vsso vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1
MSABN vabn en_3v3_b vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS d2s_pd_n_c


* d2s_rhigh (build_d2s_rhigh.py, agent F, C2 2026-10-31): unit_r2's 4 resistors, each 4 x 0.5/12.65 um
* rhigh in series (50.6 um, as rl=50.6u), 2 dummies shorted to vss; bulk = substrate (vss)
.SUBCKT d2s_rhigh sa_A sa_B sa_C1 sa_C2 sb_A sb_B sb_C1 sb_C2 vss
RA_0 sa_A A_1 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RA_1 A_1 A_2 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RA_2 A_2 A_3 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RA_3 A_3 sb_A vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RB_0 sa_B B_1 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RB_1 B_1 B_2 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RB_2 B_2 B_3 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RB_3 B_3 sb_B vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RC1_0 sa_C1 C1_1 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RC1_1 C1_1 C1_2 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RC1_2 C1_2 C1_3 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RC1_3 C1_3 sb_C1 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RC2_0 sa_C2 C2_1 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RC2_1 C2_1 C2_2 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RC2_2 C2_2 C2_3 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
RC2_3 C2_3 sb_C2 vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
Rdummy_L vss vss vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
Rdummy_R vss vss vss rhigh w=0.5u l=12.65u m=1 b=0
.ENDS d2s_rhigh

* bias_tree_pd as drawn by agent F (C2 2026-10-31): the sheet's bias_tree_pd WITHOUT Xd = bias_diodes (BP, BN,
* BNC, BPC are drawn in the tails, sinks and cascode cells); the library dummies as devices.
.SUBCKT bias_tree_pd vdd vss iref vbp vbn vbpc vbnc vabp vabn en_3v3 en_3v3_b
MTGN iref en_3v3 ni vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1
MTGP iref en_3v3_b ni vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1
MTDN ni en_3v3_b vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1
MNI ni ni vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MNBP vbp ni vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MNBPC vbpc ni vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=2.4u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MNABP vabp ni vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=6u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MNdummy vss ni vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=2.4u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MPBN vbn vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MPBNC vbnc vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MPABN vabn vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=6u ng=1 m=1
MPdummy vdd vbp vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=6u ng=1 m=1
.ENDS bias_tree_pd

* SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Christoph Maier
* SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
* d2s_block (agent F, C2 stage 3): d2s_mpdda_pd + bias_tree_pd of the pad, composed from the cells' own CDLs.
* vdd = vddo = iovdd, vss = vsso = iovss (pad level); BP / BN / BPC / BNC are in the tails / sinks / cascode cells.
.SUBCKT d2s_block iovdd iovss vinp vinn vref vfb a b dabp dabn iref en_3v3 en_3v3_b
XIN vinp vref vinn vfb x y sa_A sa_B sa_C1 sa_C2 sb_A sb_B sb_C1 sb_C2 iovdd d2s_inputs_c
XTL sa_A sa_B sa_C1 sa_C2 sb_A sb_B sb_C1 sb_C2 vbp iovdd d2s_tails_c
XRH sa_A sa_B sa_C1 sa_C2 sb_A sb_B sb_C1 sb_C2 iovss d2s_rhigh
XLD l2 pl pr iovdd d2s_loads_c
XCP a l2 pl pr vbpc iovdd d2s_casc_p_c
XABP a b dabp l1 l2 vabp iovdd d2s_ab_p_c
XPDP a en_3v3 vabp iovdd iovdd d2s_pd_p_c
XSK vbn iovss x y sinks_6x6_c
XCN b l1 vbnc iovss x y d2s_casc_n_c
XABN a b dabn l1 l2 vabn iovss d2s_ab_n_c
XPDN b en_3v3_b vabn iovss iovss d2s_pd_n_c
XT iovdd iovss iref vbp vbn vbpc vbnc vabp vabn en_3v3 en_3v3_b bias_tree_pd
.ENDS d2s_block
